{"text":"正始五年四月二日，闕口關功曹敦光造釋加文佛石像一區，上爲七世父母、所生父母、因緣眷屬，當與善居，所願從心。","tags":[{"name":"LocName","term":"伊闕","refId":"PL000000023647","text":"闕口","start":9,"end":11},{"name":"PersonName","term":"敦光","refId":null,"text":"敦光","start":14,"end":16},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"釋迦","refId":null,"text":"釋加","start":17,"end":19},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"因緣","refId":null,"text":"因緣","start":38,"end":40}]}